<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 38.44 to 6346.77.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 2.40 to 385.17.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.25.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1572 to 927.</p>
<p>Volume was 500,398,280, compared with 519,835,560 Tuesday.</p>
